{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-6-1","title":"Proverbs 6:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Against suretyship; 6 idleness; 12 and mischievousness. 16 Seven things hateful to God. 20 The blessings of obedience. 25 The mischiefs of whoredom.</p>\n<p>if thou be. 11:15; 17:18; 20:16; 22:26; 27:13; Ge 43:9; 44:32,33; Job 17:3 Phm 1:18,19; Heb 7:22 thou hast.To strike, or join hands, was an ancient form of entering into contracts in all counties and all ages.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-2","title":"Proverbs 6:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>12:13; 18:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-3","title":"Proverbs 6:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>when. 2Sa 24:14; 2Ch 12:5; Ps 31:8 go. Ex 10:3; 2Ch 36:12; Jas 4:10 and make sure thy friend. or, so shalt thou prevail withthey friend.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-4","title":"Proverbs 6:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>10,11; Ps 132:4; Ec 9:10; Mt 24:17,18; Mr 13:35,36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-5","title":"Proverbs 6:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>as a bird. 1:17; Ps 11:1; 124:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-6","title":"Proverbs 6:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the ant.The ant has been famous in all ages for its social habits, foresight, economy and industry. Collecting their food at the proper seasons, they bite off the ends of the grain to prevent it from germinating, and lay it up in cells till needed.</p>\n<p>1:17; Job 12:7,8; Isa 1:3; Mt 6:26 thou. 9; 10:26; 13:4; 15:19; 18:9; 19:15,24; 20:4; 21:25; 22:13; 24:30-34 26:13-16; Mt 25:26; Ro 12:11; Heb 6:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-7","title":"Proverbs 6:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Job 38:39-41; 39:1-12,26-30; 41:4-34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-8","title":"Proverbs 6:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>30:25; 1Ti 6:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-9","title":"Proverbs 6:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>How. 1:22; 24:33,34; Jer 4:14 when. Ps 94:8; Joh 1:6; Ro 13:11; Eph 5:14; 1Th 5:2-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-10","title":"Proverbs 6:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>6; 23:33,34; 24:33,34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-11","title":"Proverbs 6:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>10:4; 13:4; 20:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-12","title":"Proverbs 6:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>naughty. 11:6; 17:4; 1Sa 17:28; Jer 24:2,8-10; Jas 1:21 walketh. 14; 2:12; 4:24; 8:13; Ps 10:3,7; 36:3; 52:2-4; 59:7; 73:8,9; Mt 12:34 Ac 20:30; 1Ti 5:13; Tit 1:10,11; Jas 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-13","title":"Proverbs 6:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>5:6; 10:10; Job 15:12; Ps 35:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-14","title":"Proverbs 6:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Frowardness. 2:14; 16:28-30; 21:8 he deviseth. 18; Ps 36:4; Isa 32:7; 57:20; Eze 11:2; Mic 2:1 soweth. Heb. casteth forth. 19; 16:28; 22:8; 26:17-22; Ho 8:7; Ro 16:17; Ga 6:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-15","title":"Proverbs 6:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>shall his. 1:27; 29:1; Ps 73:18-20; Isa 30:13; 1Th 5:3 he be. 2Ch 36:16; Ps 50:22; Jer 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-16","title":"Proverbs 6:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>six. 8:13; 30:18,21,24,29; Am 1:3,6,9,11; 2:1,4,6 an. 3:32; 11:1,20; 15:8,9; 17:15; 20:10,23; De 18:10-12; 23:18; 24:4 De 25:16; Re 21:27 unto him. Heb. of his soul. Ps 11:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-17","title":"Proverbs 6:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>A proud look. Heb. Haughty eyes. 30:13; Ps 10:4; 18:27; 73:6-8; 101:5; 131:1; Isa 2:11; 3:9,16 1Pe 5:5 lying. 12:22; 14:5; 26:28; Ps 5:6; 120:2,3; Ho 4:1,2; Joh 8:44; Re 22:15 and hands. 1:11; De 27:25; 2Ki 24:4; Isa 1:15; 59:3-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-18","title":"Proverbs 6:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>heart. 24:8; Ge 6:5; Ps 36:4; Jer 4:14; Mic 2:1; Zec 8:17 feet. 1:16; Isa 59:7; Ro 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-19","title":"Proverbs 6:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>A false. 12:17; 19:5,9; 25:18; Ex 20:16; 23:1; De 19:16-20; 1Ki 21:10-15 Ps 27:12; 35:11; Mt 15:19; 26:59; Ac 6:13 that soweth. 14; 16:28; 22:10; 26:20; 2Ti 2:23; Jas 3:14-16,18; 3Jo 1:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-20","title":"Proverbs 6:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>1:8,9; 7:1-4; 23:22; 30:11; De 21:18; 27:16; Eph 6:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-21","title":"Proverbs 6:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>3:3; 4:6,21; 7:3,4; Ex 13:16; De 6:8; 2Co 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-22","title":"Proverbs 6:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>2:11; 3:23,24; Ps 17:4; 43:3; 119:9,11,24,54,97,148; Da 11:18-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-23","title":"Proverbs 6:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the commandment. Ps 19:8; 119:98-100,105; Isa 8:20; 2Pe 1:19 lamp. or, candle. Re 2:5 and reproofs. 5:12; 15:31; 29:15; Le 19:17; Ps 141:5 the way. 3:18; 4:4,13; 15:24; Jer 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-24","title":"Proverbs 6:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>keep. 2:16; 5:3; 7:5; Ec 7:26 of the tongue of a strange woman. or, of the strange tongue.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-25","title":"Proverbs 6:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Lust. 2Sa 11:2-5; Mt 5:28; Jas 1:14,15 take. 2Ki 9:30; *marg: So 4:9; Isa 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-26","title":"Proverbs 6:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>by. 5:10; 29:3,8; Lu 15:13-15,30 a piece. 1Sa 2:36 the adulteress. Heb. the woman of a man, or, a man's wife.hunt. Ge 39:14; Eze 13:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-27","title":"Proverbs 6:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Job 31:9-12; Ho 7:4-7; Jas 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-29","title":"Proverbs 6:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>he that. Ge 12:18,19; Le 20:10; 2Sa 11:3,4; 12:9,10; 16:21; Jer 5:8,9 Eze 22:11; Mal 3:5 toucheth. Ge 20:4-7; 26:10,11; 1Co 7:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-31","title":"Proverbs 6:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>if. Ex 22:1,3,4; 2Sa 12:6; Job 20:18; Lu 19:8 he shall give. Mt 18:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-32","title":"Proverbs 6:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>lacketh. 7:7; Ge 39:9,10; 41:39; Ec 7:25,26; Jer 5:8,21; Ro 1:22-24 understanding. Heb. heart. Ho 4:11,12 destroyeth. 2:18,19; 5:22,23; 7:22,23; 8:36; 9:16-18; Eze 18:31; Ho 13:9 Heb 13:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-33","title":"Proverbs 6:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>A wound. 5:9-11; Jud 16:19-21; Ps 38:1-8; 51:8 and his. Ge 49:4; 1Ki 15:5; Ne 13:26; Ps 51:1; *title Mt 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-34","title":"Proverbs 6:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>27:4; Nu 5:14; 25:11; Jud 19:29,30; So 8:6; 1Co 10:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-6-35","title":"Proverbs 6:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>regard. Heb. accept the face of. 4:3; 7:13; 8:25; 2Ki 5:1; *marg: Isa 2:9; Mal 2:9; *marg:</p>"}]}